  "facts": [
    "The Electro Fangs is a piece of Common Hero Equipment for the Dragon Duke. It is unlocked when the Blacksmith is upgraded to level 10, which requires Town Hall 17. It appears as a metal jaw with a set of fangs which glow sky blue, with a lightning bolt passing from the mouth.",
    "When equipped, the Dragon Duke's attacks will gain a chain lightning property, which deals damage to targets near the Duke's initial target. Multiple targets can be struck with this effect, with successive targets taking 20% less damage than the target before them."
  ],
